// Configurations/Signing.local.xcconfig.example
//
// Copy this file to Configurations/Signing.local.xcconfig and fill in your
// Apple Team ID. The local file is gitignored — never commit it.
//
// Find your Team ID:
//   • Xcode → Settings → Accounts → select your Apple ID → Team ID column
//   • Or: https://developer.apple.com/account (10-character string, e.g. AB12CD34EF)

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE
